HMAC-SHA-384, HMAC-SHA-512, HMAC-SHA3-224, HMAC-SHA3-256,
HMAC-SHA3-384, and HMAC-SHA3-512 using the CMH hash core.

Co-developed-by: Saravanakrishnan Krishnamoorthy <skrishnamoorthy@rambus.com>
