The AX88772D, AX88179A and AX88279 are 100MBit, 1GBit and respectively
2.5 GBit PHYs that are found in ASIX USB-Ethernet controllers of the
same name.

Signed-off-by: Birger Koblitz <mail@birger-koblitz.de>
